<i>
<p></p><b>Questions 31-32</b>
 ask about lending policies at your institution for private student loans. Question 31 asks you to compare your current policies on approving applications for private student loans compared to those policies a year ago. Question 32 asks about your bank's anticipated holdings of private student loans over the next year.    </i>
